# Build context: the repository root. Send only what the root Dockerfile reads, so
# docs, plans, scripts and Events changes neither upload nor invalidate anything.
# Other builds from the root context (scripts/cache-benchmark) use .dockerignore.
*
!server/Cargo.toml
!server/Cargo.lock
!server/kv/Cargo.toml
!server/kv/src/
!server/check/Cargo.toml
!server/src/
!orm/python/pyproject.toml
!orm/python/README.md
!orm/python/LICENSE
!orm/python/src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
